---
title: "syncAllRoles (stem-bot-v2: src/api/rolesSyncAll.ts)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_fetch_members: supabase.from("members").select("*").is("deleted_at", null)
    q_fetch_members --> q_500: membersError or !members
    q_fetch_members --> q_check_empty: members fetched
    q_500 --> [*]: res.status(500)
    q_check_empty --> q_respond_empty: members.length === 0
    q_check_empty --> q_iter: members.length > 0
    q_respond_empty --> [*]: res.json(synced = 0)
    q_iter --> q_sync_one: for memberData of members
    q_sync_one --> q_get_discord: getMember(memberData.discord_uid)
    q_get_discord --> q_skip: member not found
    q_get_discord --> q_sync_gen: member found
    q_skip --> q_iter_next: results.failed++
    q_sync_gen --> q_sync_teams: sync generation role
    q_sync_teams --> q_sync_leader: sync team roles
    q_sync_leader --> q_sync_status: sync leader role
    q_sync_status --> q_sync_member: sync status roles (JH/H/OB)
    q_sync_member --> q_sync_verified: sync member role
    q_sync_verified --> q_iter_next: sync verified role, results.synced++
    q_iter_next --> q_iter: next member
    q_iter_next --> q_respond: all members processed
    q_respond --> [*]: res.json(success, synced, failed, total, errors)

    note right of q_iter
        INV-001: Sequential processing (no parallel member sync)
        INV-002: One member failure does not abort entire sync
        INV-003: Missing generation roles silently skipped (no role removal)
        INV-004: No rate limiting on Discord API calls
    end note
